                <p style="margin:0 0 20px;"><strong style="color:#0B0F14;">Olivia</strong> invited you to join <strong style="color:#0B0F14;">Acme Security</strong> on REDOVA.</p>
                <table role="presentation" width="100%" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" bgcolor="#F9FAFB" style="width:100%;background-color:#F9FAFB;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;border-radius:8px;">
                  <tr><td style="padding:14px 16px;font-size:14px;line-height:23px;color:#475467;">Your role: <strong style="color:#0B0F14;">AI Developer</strong><br />Expires: Sat, 31 Oct 2026 12:00:00 GMT</td></tr>
                </table>
                <table role="presentation" width="100%" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="width:100%;">
                  <tr>
                    <td align="left" style="padding:24px 0 20px;">
