                <p style="margin:0 0 8px;color:#667085;font-size:12px;line-height:20px;">If the button does not work, copy and paste this link into your browser:</p>
                <p style="margin:0 0 24px;font-size:12px;line-height:20px;word-break:break-all;overflow-wrap:anywhere;"><a href="https://api.redova.io/api/auth/reset-password/t" style="color:#C8102E;text-decoration:underline;word-break:break-all;">https://api.redova.io/api/auth/reset-password/t</a></p>
                <p style="margin:0 0 18px;color:#344054;font-size:14px;line-height:22px;">This link expires in <strong>30 minutes</strong> and can be used once. Request IP: 203.0.113.7.</p>
